For the NetHack production team, here is my idea for a new race of monsters
that can inhabit the world of NetHack 3.1

Terminators ;) (Yes, call me a sick little monkey ;)

All terminators are represented by a "T".

There are 3 kinds of Terminators.

1) The Terminator Endoskeleton, HP 100-150, HD 15, resistant to death and
cancellation wands. Special weapons do normal damage. Endoskeletions, or for
that matter, any Terminator cannot be affected by Cockatrices, Cockatrice
corpses or Medusa. They also cannot be charmed, tamed or put to sleep.

Terminators do not need to eat, and thus a dead terminator will leave
no corpse behind.

Terminators will also pick up and wield or wear any weapon or armor that
they find, making them truly formidible opponents.

2) Series 800, Model 101 (Arnold). HP 250-400, HD 25, as before except
Special weapons do only half damage. Otherwise immune to normal weapons.

3) The T-1000, HP N/A, HD 10, immune to all attacks from physical weapons.
There is only one method to kill a T-1000. First, hit it with a wand of
cold until it freezes. Second, hit it with a wand of Magic Missile to
shatter it. and Finally, zap it with a wand of fire to melt it forever.

The T-1000 cannot be swallowed if the character is a Purple Worm/Lurker Above
type character, as he would slice his way through your stomach shredding
you to ribbons and killing you instantly. A YAFM perhaps! ;)

Terminators cannot be genocided or polymorphed.

Soulstealer does do special damage. After all, Terminators don't have
souls to steal. ;)

The player cannot polymorph into a Terminator. That would e cheating! ;)

The legend about Terminators is that Desendents of the Wizard of Yendor
have sent these being back in time to protect the Wizard. Or were they
sent to destroy YOU? ;)

And yes, I know NetHack is a Medeival game, but considering the creators let
Quantum Mechanics and their ilk in, they could logistacally put Terminators
in. :)

